  "missed_babysitting_gate": "Before Stage12140 training, row audits checked option legality/differentiability but did not enforce task-specific semantic target diversity or task-family-compatible target roles.",
  "new_required_gates": [
    "For transition_next_action, target semantic value must be an action such as SELECT_TEST, RUN_VERIFIER, RETRIEVE_EVIDENCE, PLAN_PATCH, ABSTAIN_OR_ROLLBACK, or FINISH; it must not be an evidence candidate object.",
    "For transition_continue_or_stop, target semantic value must be CONTINUE/STOP/ABSTAIN/NEEDS_MORE_EVIDENCE with explicit completion-gate evidence.",
    "For transition_verifier_transition, target semantic value must be a verifier status such as PASS_TO_PASS, PASS_CURRENT_BUILD, PASS_CURRENT_BUILD_AND_RUN, NOT_EXERCISED, INSUFFICIENT_EVIDENCE, or VERIFIER_REMOVED.",
    "For transition_candidate_selection, target semantic value may be a candidate artifact, but candidate roles must be root-local and not reused as targets for all other task families.",
    "For evidence_citation, target semantic value must be an evidence role/item such as verifier_and_test_constraint or candidate_change_surface, not a generic selected-test-backed candidate unless the task explicitly asks for candidate selection.",
    "A materialization package must fail if every task family for a root has the same target_semantic_value.",
    "A materialization package must report target-role entropy by task and root before any training request is emitted."
